      "sceneId": "lingxiao",
      "characterId": "shen",
      "conditions": [{ "type": "event_completed", "eventId": "shen.frostbond.05.tea-vow" }],
      "clue": "完成「茶中旧约」后，未来两日留意云州山河图上的霜色剑光",
      "start": "a",
      "nodes": {
        "a": { "id": "a", "type": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "text": "霜色光点将你带到一座断桥。桥下妖雾翻涌，沈清霜独自撑着护阵，白衣已被血浸透一角。", "next": "b", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "shake" },
        "b": { "id": "b", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "谁让你来的？退到阵外，这是命令。", "mood": "急切", "next": "c", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "c": { "id": "c", "type": "line", "speaker": "player", "text": "师尊教过我，剑修不把同行之人留在身后。", "next": "d", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "d": { "id": "d", "type": "choice", "prompt": "妖雾正在撞击最后一层剑阵。", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "shake", "options": [
          { "id": "share", "label": "与她并肩守住阵眼", "next": "e", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 7 }] },
          { "id": "lead", "label": "背起她，从断桥另一端突围", "next": "f", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 6 }] }
        ] },
        "e": { "id": "e", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "那便只许站在我身侧。若你受伤，我会分神。", "mood": "动容", "next": "g", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "f": { "id": "f", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "放我下来……罢了。至少这一次，让我相信你的判断。", "mood": "无奈而安心", "next": "g", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "g": { "id": "g", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "从前总是我带你回家。原来有一天，也可以轮到你。", "mood": "释然", "next": "end", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "end": { "id": "end", "type": "end", "summary": "断桥后的晨雾里，你们第一次真正并肩而行。", "effects": [{ "type": "add_player_exp", "amount": 80 }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shen.frostbond.07.torn-order",
      "title": "未发的禁令",
      "subtitle": "有些念头被写下，也被亲手撕去",
      "chapter": "霜华心契 · 柒",
      "type": "心事",
      "trigger": "talk",
      "priority": 138,
      "once": true,
      "journal": true,
      "cardStyle": "special",
      "defaultPortrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp",
      "sceneId": "lingxiao",
      "characterId": "shen",
      "conditions": [
        { "type": "character", "value": "shen" },
        { "type": "event_completed", "eventId": "shen.frostbond.06.broken-bridge" }
      ],
      "clue": "完成「断桥同归」后与沈清霜交谈",
      "start": "a",
      "nodes": {
        "a": { "id": "a", "type": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "text": "她将一叠撕碎的符纸放在桌上。拼合后的第一行，是一封禁止你独自下山的掌门令。", "next": "b", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "b": { "id": "b", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "断桥回来那夜，我写了这道禁令。写完又觉得，自己十分可笑。", "mood": "自嘲", "next": "c", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "c": { "id": "c", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "我若凭修为把你留住，留下的也只是一个不再信我的人。", "mood": "清醒", "next": "d", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "d": { "id": "d", "type": "line", "speaker": "player", "text": "想让我留下，可以直接告诉我。决定仍由我来做。", "next": "e", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "e": { "id": "e", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "那我现在告诉你：我舍不得你走，也愿意学着不以舍不得为锁。", "mood": "坦然", "next": "end", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 8 }, { "type": "set_flag", "key": "shen.frostbond.trust", "value": true }] },
        "end": { "id": "end", "type": "end", "summary": "符纸在灯焰里化为灰烬，一段关系却因此变得更轻，也更牢。" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shen.frostbond.08.lantern-festival",
      "title": "灯下失言",
      "subtitle": "每三日一次的小灯会，她准备得太认真",
      "chapter": "霜华心契 · 捌",
      "type": "情缘",
      "trigger": "calendar_event",
      "priority": 136,
      "once": true,
      "journal": true,
      "cardStyle": "special",
      "openingEffect": "flash_white",
      "defaultPortrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp",
      "calendarEvent": { "mode": "interval", "everyDays": 3, "offsetDay": 3, "doodle": "festival" },
      "sceneId": "lingxiao",
      "characterId": "shen",
      "conditions": [{ "type": "event_completed", "eventId": "shen.frostbond.07.torn-order" }],
      "clue": "完成「未发的禁令」后，等待下一次三日灯会",
      "start": "a",
      "nodes": {
        "a": { "id": "a", "type": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "text": "问剑峰挂起了从未有过的暖色小灯。每一盏灯下，都系着你曾随口提过的愿望。", "next": "b", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "b": { "id": "b", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "只是弟子们练手做的。你不要误会，也不要一盏一盏去看。", "mood": "不自然", "next": "c", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "c": { "id": "c", "type": "line", "speaker": "player", "text": "这一盏写着：愿他每次远行都平安。也是弟子写的？", "next": "d", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "d": { "id": "d", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "……那一盏是我写的。只写了一盏，旁的都不是。", "mood": "被拆穿", "next": "e", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "e": { "id": "e", "type": "line", "speaker": "player", "text": "可这里有三十七盏。", "next": "f", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "f": { "id": "f", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "风大，灯多一些才不会全灭。你若再数，我便把它们都收起来。", "mood": "羞恼", "next": "g", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "g": { "id": "g", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "不过最中间那盏可以留下。你我各写一半，谁也不许偷看。", "mood": "期待", "next": "end", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 7 }] },
        "end": { "id": "end", "type": "end", "summary": "两行字在灯火里重叠，谁都没有追问对方写了什么。" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shen.frostbond.09.heart-seal",
      "title": "心印两途",
      "subtitle": "守护不该成为烙印",
      "chapter": "霜华心契 · 玖",
      "type": "主线",
      "trigger": "time_change",
      "priority": 134,
      "once": true,
      "journal": true,
      "cardStyle": "special",
      "openingEffect": "flash_black",
      "defaultPortrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp",
      "sceneId": "lingxiao",
      "characterId": "shen",
      "conditions": [
        { "type": "period", "value": "深夜" },
        { "type": "event_completed", "eventId": "shen.frostbond.08.lantern-festival" }
      ],
      "clue": "完成「灯下失言」后，在凌霄殿等到深夜",
      "start": "a",
      "nodes": {
        "a": { "id": "a", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "你的旧伤仍残着寒意。我可以留一道剑心真气，在你遇险时替你挡下一击。", "mood": "郑重", "next": "b", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "b": { "id": "b", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "但它会让我感知你是否受伤。你若不愿意，我便换成普通护符。", "mood": "克制", "next": "c", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "c": { "id": "c", "type": "choice", "prompt": "她摊开掌心，剑心印与普通护符并列其上。", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat", "options": [
          { "id": "seal", "label": "接受剑心印，与她共同承担感应", "next": "d", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 7 }, { "type": "set_flag", "key": "shen.frostbond.heartseal", "value": true }] },
          { "id": "charm", "label": "选择护符，感谢她尊重自己的边界", "next": "e", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 7 }, { "type": "set_flag", "key": "shen.frostbond.charm", "value": true }] }
        ] },
        "d": { "id": "d", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "好。不是标记，也不是枷锁。若有一天你想收回，我会亲手替你解开。", "mood": "珍重", "next": "f", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "e": { "id": "e", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "护符也很好。你愿意把平安带在身上，已经足够。", "mood": "温柔", "next": "f", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "f": { "id": "f", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "原来关心一个人，不必知道他每一步走向哪里。只要他愿意回来告诉我。", "mood": "明悟", "next": "end", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "end": { "id": "end", "type": "end", "summary": "守护有了两种形状，而选择权始终留在你手中。" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shen.frostbond.10.moonfall-vow",
      "title": "月落同途",
      "subtitle": "师徒之外，你们重新选择彼此",
      "chapter": "霜华心契 · 拾",
      "type": "情缘",
      "trigger": "talk",
      "priority": 132,
      "once": true,
      "journal": true,
      "cardStyle": "special",
      "openingEffect": "flash_white",
      "defaultPortrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp",
      "sceneId": "lingxiao",
      "characterId": "shen",
      "conditions": [
        { "type": "character", "value": "shen" },
        { "type": "event_completed", "eventId": "shen.frostbond.09.heart-seal" }
      ],
      "clue": "完成「心印两途」后与沈清霜交谈",
      "start": "a",
      "nodes": {
        "a": { "id": "a", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "今夜不讲剑，也不谈门规。我只想问你一句：若没有师徒之名，你还愿意坐在这里吗？", "mood": "平静下的紧张", "next": "b", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "b": { "id": "b", "type": "choice", "prompt": "月色落在她未曾移开的目光里。", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat", "options": [
          { "id": "companion", "label": "愿以同行之人的身份留下", "next": "c", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 10 }, { "type": "set_flag", "key": "shen.frostbond.companion", "value": true }] },
          { "id": "slow", "label": "愿留下，但希望彼此慢慢走近", "next": "d", "effects": [{ "type": "relationship", "characterId": "shen", "amount": 8 }, { "type": "set_flag", "key": "shen.frostbond.slow", "value": true }] }
        ] },
        "c": { "id": "c", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "那便不必再问谁欠谁一条命。往后的路，一人一半。", "mood": "释然欢喜", "next": "e", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "d": { "id": "d", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "慢一些很好。我等过许多年，不会急着向你讨一个答案。", "mood": "温柔", "next": "e", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "e": { "id": "e", "type": "line", "speaker": "player", "text": "月快落了。师尊还要我走吗？", "next": "f", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp" },
        "f": { "id": "f", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "不走也好。茶还热，山风也静。你想坐到什么时候，都由你。", "mood": "不再掩饰", "next": "g", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "heartbeat" },
        "g": { "id": "g", "type": "line", "speaker": "shen", "text": "还有——这次不是师命。是我想请你留下。", "mood": "坦白", "next": "end", "portrait": "/assets/characters/shen-qingshuang.webp", "stageEffect": "soft_glow" },
        "end": { "id": "end", "type": "end", "summary": "月落之后，问剑峰仍有两盏灯。沈清霜将「天剑·无邪」的玉简交到你手中。", "effects": [{ "type": "learn_skill", "skillId": 10023 }, { "type": "add_player_exp", "amount": 120 }, { "type": "set_flag", "key": "shen.frostbond.complete", "value": true }] }
      }
    }
  ]
